message: "If you use MAGPIE, please cite it as below."
title: "MAGPIE: Macondo Accordant Game Program and Inference Engine"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A crossword game playing and analysis program: move generation, Monte Carlo
  simulation, inference, pre-endgame and endgame solving, game analysis,
  autoplay and leave generation.
